@startuml
title Teacher Swap Request State Diagram

[*] --> PENDING : Teacher A ส่งคำขอ (Request Swap)
PENDING --> ACCEPTED : Teacher B ตอบรับ (Accept)
PENDING --> REJECTED : Teacher B ปฏิเสธ (Reject)
PENDING --> CANCELLED : Teacher A ยกเลิก (Cancel)
ACCEPTED --> APPROVED : Admin อนุมัติ (Approve)
ACCEPTED --> REJECTED : Admin ปฏิเสธ (Reject)

APPROVED --> [*]
REJECTED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]

note right of PENDING
  Teacher A ยกเลิกได้เฉพาะตอน PENDING
end note

note right of ACCEPTED
  Admin ปฏิเสธได้เฉพาะตอน ACCEPTED
end note
@enduml